   {
    "en": "The Dazzling Transformation of a Lady Who Was Called Unsightly"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Transformation of the Noble Girl Once Called Ugly Into a Captivating Woman"
   },
   {
    "zh": "被吐槽土气小姐的华丽变身"
